      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {由于} A,B \\text {互相独立，所以} P(AB) = P(A)P(B), \\\\ \\text {再根据概率的性质} P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(AB) = \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{2}{3}. \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {由于} A,B \\text {互相独立，所以} P(AB) = P(A)P(B), \\\\ \\text {再根据概率的性质} P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(AB) = \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{2}{3}. \\end{array}</div>"
